<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32850" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκροος</span></b> , 
			contr.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκρόμβ-ρους</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>outflow, issue,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκροον ἔχειν ἐς θάλασσαν,</span> of
			rivers, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.129
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>An.</u>
				4.3.2
			</span></i>(pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατ᾽ ἔκροον</span> by <i>excretion,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				2.1.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>outlet,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				351a10
			</span></i>; <i>means of escape,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Virg.</u>
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
